<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Russian Cup soccer</p>
<p>third round matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p> CSKA Moscow		0    Zarya Leninsk-Kuznetsk  0</p>
<p>(Zarya won 8-7 on penalties)</p>
<p> Zenit St Petersburg    0    Lokomotiv Chita	   0</p>
<p>(Zenit won 4-3 on penalties)</p>
<p> Krylya Sovietov Samara 1    Alania Vladikavkaz	0</p>
<p> Torpedo LM Moscow	6    Lada Togliatti	    1</p>
<p>Played Tuesday:</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow	    1    Oryol			 0</p>
<p> Spartak Moscow	   4    Rostselmash Rostov	1</p>
<p> Rotor Volgograd	  4    Avtozapchast Baksan     0</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Moscow	 5    UralAZ Miass		0</p>
<p>Quarter-finals (to be played May 6-7):</p>
<p>Zarya Leninsk-Kuznetsk v Dynamo Moscow</p>
<p>Zenit St Petersburg v Spartak Moscow</p>
<p>Krylya Sovietov Samara v Rotor Volgograd</p>
<p>Torpedo LM Moscow v Lokomotiv Moscow</p>
<p>Semifinals to be played May 20-21 with final on June 11.</p>
</text>
